  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_type": "isnad",
      "arabic_text": "أَحْمَدُ بْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ عَنِ الْحَسَنِ بْنِ مَحْبُوبٍ عَنْ أَبِي وَلَّادٍ الْحَنَّاطِ قَالَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Aḥmad ibn Muḥammad, from al-Ḥasan ibn Maḥbūb, from Abī Wallād al-Ḥannāṭ, who said:"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "سَأَلْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ عَنْ رَجُلٍ قُتِلَ وَلَهُ أَبٌ وَأُمٌّ وَابْنٌ، فَقَالَ الِابْنُ: أَنَا أُرِيدُ أَنْ أَقْتُلَ قَاتِلَ أَبِي، وَقَالَ الْأَبُ: أَنَا أَعْفُو، وَقَالَتِ الْأُمُّ: أَنَا آخُذُ الدِّيَةَ. قَالَ: «فَلْيُعْطِ الِابْنُ أُمَّ الْمَقْتُولِ السُّدُسَ مِنَ الدِّيَةِ، وَيُعْطِيَ وَرَثَةَ الْقَاتِلِ السُّدُسَ مِنَ الدِّيَةِ حَقَّ الْأَبِ الَّذِي عَفَا عَنْهُ، وَلْيَقْتُلْهُ»."
      "translations": {
        "en": "I asked Abā ʿAbdillāh عليه السلام about a man who was killed, and he had a father, a mother, and a son. The son said, “I want to kill my father’s killer.” The father said, “I pardon.” The mother said, “I take the diyah.” He عليه السلام said: “Then let the son give the mother of the slain one a sixth of the diyah, and give the heirs of the killer a sixth of the diyah, being the share of the father who pardoned him, and let him kill him.”"
      }
    }
  ],
  "translations": {
    "en": {
      "summary": "This hadith gives a legal ruling concerning disagreement among the heirs of a murder victim over qiṣāṣ, pardon, and diyah. It explains how the son may proceed with killing the murderer while compensating the other entitled parties according to their legal shares.",
      "seo_question": "What is the ruling when the heirs of a murder victim disagree between qiṣāṣ, pardon, and diyah?",
      "key_terms": {
        "قُتِلَ": "was killed; refers to the murdered victim in the case",
        "الِابْنُ": "the son; the heir seeking qiṣāṣ",
        "الْأَبُ": "the father; the heir who chose to pardon",
        "الْأُمُّ": "the mother; the heir who chose to take diyah",
        "الدِّيَةَ": "blood money; the financial compensation due in lieu of retaliation or as a share settlement",
        "السُّدُسَ": "one sixth; the specified legal share mentioned in the ruling",
        "وَرَثَةَ الْقَاتِلِ": "the heirs of the killer; those to whom part of the compensation is to be given",
        "عَفَا": "pardoned; refers to the father's waiver of retaliation"
      }
    }
  },
